  "notable_quotes": [
    "Three Zn(II) MOF analogues, xF-MAC-3, were synthesized from Hdmtrz and carboxylates with different fluorination degrees, all adopting a (6,6)-connected pcu-b net.",
    "Fluorine atoms regulate xF-MAC-3 structures by enlarging the carboxylate torsion angle φ and increasing the structures' space group.",
    "Fluorinated carboxylate MOF analogues can be difficult to synthesize because fluorination strongly alters ligand acidity and coordination ability."
